---
import PolicyLayout from "../components/PolicyLayout.astro"
import { SITE } from "../lib/site"
---
<PolicyLayout title="Affiliate Program" description="Earn commission sharing TOONHUB anime figures.">
  <p>Love Toonhub? Share the collection and earn commission on every referred order.</p>
  <h2>How it works</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>Apply with your social or site details</li>
    <li>Get a unique tracking link</li>
    <li>Earn a percentage of net sales from customers you send our way</li>
    <li>Payouts monthly once you hit the minimum threshold</li>
  </ul>
  <h2>Apply</h2>
  <p>Email {SITE.email} with the subject “Affiliate application” and include your platform, audience size, and content niche. We'll reply within a few business days.</p>
</PolicyLayout>
